## Add the package to your application

This folder is a self-contained SwiftPM package exposing the `{{identifier tii.protocol.name 'swift' 'type'}}Client` library. From your consuming package's `Package.swift`:

```swift
dependencies: [
    .package(name: "{{identifier tii.protocol.name 'swift' 'type'}}Client", path: "path/to/this/folder"),
    .package(url: "https://github.com/tx3-lang/swift-sdk.git", from: "0.15.0"),
